@native-thread-content
Feature: Owned native thread contents and goals
  Scenario: Content inputs preserve arbitrary bounded JSON and native goal provenance
    Then thread content inputs preserve payloads history items nullable budgets and goal origins

  Scenario: Content inputs reject malformed JSON and name invalid fields
    Then thread content inputs reject unsafe shapes excessive values and authority overrides

  Scenario: Content authority binds loaded ownership and autonomous goal events
    Then content authority separates storage mutations from execution and owns autonomous goal turns

  Scenario: Content form projection retains raw item JSON and saved workflow models
    Then content forms preserve opaque item JSON nullable budgets and their saved graph contracts
